Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.95,0:00:48.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur10}Shine it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.54,0:00:53.91,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur10}Shine it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:56.42,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\blur10}All that friction I’m feeling now
