Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.63,0:01:05.13,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\blur10}How can I keep this in control and work it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.13,0:01:08.35,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)\blur10}Shouting, going through shadows in my view
