Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.37,0:01:40.88,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur10}We see the gathering rays spread away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:43.76,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\blur10}With the fortunes in our souls
